      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006001,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "来到日本以后，我遇见了拉莫娜和千寿历她们。/n也登上舞台，让很多人看见了我。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "20060010030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006001005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006001,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可是，唯一不好的地方就是……夏天太热。/n湿漉漉地缠在身上，很不舒服。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "20060010040",
